  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fleet Vehicle Source obligated $447M in FY2026 to date on federal contracts. Fleet Vehicle Source received 14,915 awards in the period, with an average award size of $30K, and obligations are up 14.3% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations show variability: FY21 was $182M, FY22 was $232M, FY23 was $474M, FY24 was $256M, FY25 was $391M, and FY26 stands at $447M. Fleet Vehicle Source’s current-year total is a fiscal year to date figure. The mix of many small awards and the cited average award size suggests procurement activity spread across numerous transactions rather than a few outsized awards. Contract obligations here refer to amounts obligated; award-value figures in other tables are total contract values and may differ from obligations.",
